      "deltaSummaryMarkdown": "Inspected the by-hand fallback in `docs/releasing.md`: the only change is the added `awk '/^## \\[X\\.Y\\.Z\\]/ { found = 1; next } /^## \\[/ && found { exit } found' CHANGELOG.md > notes.md` line before `gh release create ... --notes-file notes.md`, inside the existing bash block (no Rust block added). Ran it with `1.0.0` substituted against the current `CHANGELOG.md`: it prints the 1.0.0 section body (lead paragraph through the last entry) without the heading and stops at the next section, so the earlier non-blocking note about the undefined `notes.md` is addressed. The rest of the reviewed content is unchanged; the s2 checks are recorded as passing on the new snapshot.",
